---
title: Chicken and Green Lentil Stew
source: claude
servings: 4
tags: [soup, freezer, instant-pot]
cook time: 12 minutes
---

> About 16 g fiber and 40 g protein per serving.

Put @chicken thigh{1.5%lb}, @green lentils{1.5%cups}(dry; brown lentils also work), @carrot{3}(chopped), @celery{3%stalks}(chopped), @onion{1}(chopped), @garlic{4%cloves}(minced), @diced tomatoes{14.5%oz}, @chicken broth{4%cups}(low-sodium) and @dried thyme{1%tsp} in an #Instant Pot{}.

Seal and pressure cook for ~{12%minutes}, then let the pressure release naturally.

After reheating, stir in @spinach{5%oz} until wilted.
